Rule 1: Identical Prompt (Ensures a fair comparison across models.)
Rule 2: Zero-Shot Generation (Measures the model’s native capability without human optimization.)
Rule 3: Prompt-Only Evaluation (Evaluates the model’s intrinsic understanding of Indian cultural context.)
Rule 4: Default Configuration (Prevents hidden advantages from custom settings.)
Rule 5: Complete Generation Log (Ensures reproducibility and transparency.)
- Model name
- Model version
- Platform used
- Prompt
- Timestamp
- Generation settings (if applicable)
- Model’s self-description
